# Card Framework Dependency

- The `com.dstuck.card-framework` package uses a local `file:` path in `manifest.json` for **development only**.
- For releases/sharing, the reference should point to the GitHub repo: `https://github.com/dstuck/unity-card-framework.git`
- When modifying card framework code, edit the **source repo** (`../unity-card-framework`), not the embedded copy Unity places in `Packages/com.dstuck.card-framework/`.
- The embedded copy in `Packages/` should be in `.gitignore`.
- **Commit `.meta` files** in `unity-card-framework` (do not gitignore them). Git UPM packages are immutable; missing metas cause CI to ignore the package and fail to compile.
